WEBVTT

00:03:58.597 --> 00:04:01.130
we have big data, data and analytics,

00:04:01.163 --> 00:04:03.930
John Deere's tractors are auto-steer.

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:06.030
And I'm like, "Are you using that?"

00:04:06.063 --> 00:04:07.230
"No." "Why?"

00:04:07.230 --> 00:04:09.130
"Well, because I lose connection.

00:04:09.730 --> 00:04:12.163
And so I can't I can't utilize it."

00:04:12.197 --> 00:04:16.597
You know, there's so many
exciting investments and innovation

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:20.530
occurring in the sector
that will make farmers more efficient,

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:22.763
will be better for climate
and the environment,

00:04:22.797 --> 00:04:24.997
I'll talk a little bit
about that in a minute,

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:26.797
but none of that can be used

00:04:26.830 --> 00:04:30.563
if we don't have the appropriate
technology access,